# Contract requests for the local category implementation; not a deployment verification.
# Change apiBase to a backend running this branch. The production API is unchanged.
@apiBase = http://localhost:3000

### All four ghees after the product seed is configured
GET {{apiBase}}/api/commerce/catalog?category_id=ghee
Accept: application/json

### Mustard oils
GET {{apiBase}}/api/commerce/catalog?category_id=mustard-oil
Accept: application/json

### Pickles
GET {{apiBase}}/api/commerce/catalog?category_id=pickles
Accept: application/json

### Existing BuyBox: unchanged unfiltered response contract
GET {{apiBase}}/api/commerce/catalog
Accept: application/json

### Invalid category: 400 INVALID_CATEGORY
GET {{apiBase}}/api/commerce/catalog?category_id=unknown
Accept: application/json
